{
  "protocol": "p1-protocol-063 PAIRED_INTERVENTION_RANDOMNESS_AND_PROVIDER_BINDING_GATE",
  "purpose": "Fail closed when same-instance paired intervention artifacts are over-read as receiver-effect-only counterfactual evidence without immutable model/provider execution identity and model-inference randomness binding. Dataset selection seeds and temperature=0 are explicitly non-authoritative for inference-randomness equivalence.",
